    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-muted">Where we work</div>
    <h2>Where agents earn their keep</h2>
    <p>Logistics. Construction. Healthcare and dental. Insurance. Manufacturing. Legal. Real estate. Hospitality. These are not glamorous markets. They are profitable ones, running on software that never got a modern layer on top, which is exactly where an agent built for one desk creates an outsized advantage.</p>
    <p>Every agent stays specific to your business instead of getting averaged into a template. That is the whole reason to generate one rather than buy a seat.</p>
  </div>
